break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span>geom_line(data=df, aes(x=Value, y=ID, colour=ID)) +<br><br>but got<br><br></span></pre></span></span></font></pre></span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:13px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:13px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">geom_path: Each group consist of only one observation. Do you need to adjust the group aesthetic?</span></pre></span></pre></span><br><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:13px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"></span></span></font><font><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br><b>The second question: Any idea how to solve this?</b></span></font><br></pre><p></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Thank you very much!<br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/--2HsCaa8Eio/VIa1bxaiZRI/AAAAAAAAAAk/rQX_PiIKZaQ/s1600/Capture.JPG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/--2HsCaa8Eio/VIa1bxaiZRI/AAAAAAAAAAk/rQX_PiIKZaQ/s1600/Capture.JPG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369828885000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PLwxZwfjd6abQXvwnVVV1\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/--2HsCaa8Eio/VIa1bxaiZRI/AAAAAAAAAAk/rQX_PiIKZaQ/s320/Capture.JPG\" height=\"207\" width=\"320\" border=\"0\"></a></p><span><font color=\"#888888\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><br><br><br><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
